{"id": "3027839", "revid": "2159", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3027839", "title": "M\u00fcnchen Hauptbahnhof", "text": "M\u00fcnchen Hauptbahnhof este principala gar\u0103 feroviar\u0103 din ora\u0219ul M\u00fcnchen. \u00cen prezent (2023) are un trafic zilnic de peste 450.000 de c\u0103l\u0103tori, fiind astfel a treia gar\u0103 ca m\u0103rime din Germania, dup\u0103 Hamburg \u0219i Frankfurt (Main) Hauptbahnhof."}
